ducts under the Copenhagen, Skoal, Red Seal, and Husky brands; oral nicotine pouches under the on! brand; and e-vapor products under the NJOY ACE brand. The company sells its products to distributors, as well as large retail organizations, such as chain stores. Altria Group, Inc. was founded in 1822 and is headquartered in Richmond, Virginia.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Salvatore  Mancuso | CEO & Director | Age 60 | Compensation: $3.6M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 5K people. Revenue per employee of $3.9M ranks in the top quartile among Consumer Defensive peers. Each employee generates $1.5M of free cash flow annually. CEO compensation is 1\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags low compensation governance risk (2/10).","financial_summary":["Altria Group, Inc. is a large-cap consumer defensive business with a $126.6B market cap on $23.3B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at -2% over the past three years and -1% annually across the full decade, and a shrinking top line is the hardest headwind any business can overcome.","Returns on capital run at 46% against a 6% cost of capital \u2014 a 40-point spread that is the clearest signature of an economic moat, with gross margins sitting at 47%.","The business throws off $9.1B in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 39 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 1.34\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, debt is moderate at 2.1\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, serviceable in normal conditions but worth watching through a downturn, and interest coverage runs at 8.4\u00d7.","Management returns a meaningful 6.3% of market cap to owners through dividends and buybacks, a strong signal of disciplined capital allocation, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome, and within its sector the business captures 5.3\u00d7 its fair share of profits, a structural advantage visible in the numbers."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Trading near 52-week highs \u2014 the market has already recognised the story","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.006754072308303686},{"text":"Significant insider selling (net $2.3M)","sev":"amber","cat":"insider","dollars":-2347724.1},{"text":"Payout ratio of 88% leaves thin coverage if earnings wobble","sev":"amber","cat":"dividend"},{"text":"Revenue growth lags most Consumer Defensive peers \u2014 losing share inside the profit pool","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Slow-motion taste and channel shifts \u2014 private label, Gen-Z health preferences, or a DTC disruption can erode decade-old brand moats without a single dramatic quarter.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Input cost inflation from agricultural commodities \u2014 when raw materials spike, pass-through pricing lags and margin compression is immediate.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"GLP-1 and health-trend demand destruction \u2014 weight-loss drugs and wellness shifts are structurally reducing consumption in snack, beverage, and packaged food categories.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Operating margins 35% above sector median \u2014 the quantitative trace of pricing power","Trading at a 34% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Market is pricing in lower growth than the company has historically delivered","Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","64 consecutive years of dividend payments \u2014 an operating record that makes the dividend claim credible","ROIC sits in the top quartile of Consumer Defensive peers \u2014 the moat is wider than the neighbourhood","Consumer Defensive sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 11% over 3 months","Consumer Defensive ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average","Consumer Defensive tends to hold up well as investors rotate into defensive names"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Are Strong Earnings Altering The Investment Case For Altria Stock (MO)?","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/strong-earnings-altering-investment-case-211514965.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793999714.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.953,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"How Much Passive Income $800,000 in Edison, International Paper, Altria and AT&T Pays Each Year","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/much-passive-income-800-000-184722000.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793991323.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.273,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"How to Build $5,450 a Month in Tax-Free Dividend Income Inside a Roth IRA","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/build-5-450-month-tax-181911000.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793989957.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.665,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":["dividend"]},{"title":"$600,000 in Dividend Stocks: How a Roth IRA Could Save You $4,460 a Year","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/600-000-dividend-stocks-roth-174735000.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793987804.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.494,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":["dividend"]},{"title":"Meet the High-Yield Dividend Stock Quietly Crushing the S&P 500. Here's Why It Has Room to Run.","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/meet-high-yield-dividend-stock-175000000.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793987657.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.361,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":["dividend"]},{"title":"4 Stocks With Solid Sh